{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this game, you are a vampire with an endless hunger. Every night, you must descend upon the village and hunt as many peasants as possible. Of course, the more you catch, the more you will want. Again and again, your hunger will never end!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506970/extras/steamGif.gif?t=1740117152\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GAMEPLAY:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each turn, you must capture villagers scattered randomly across the board. Use your cards to plan a path. To earn more points, you need to collect chess pieces of the same type. If you fail to gather enough points by the end of the night, your eternal life will come to an end. If you survive, you can add new cards to your deck or upgrade your existing ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506970/extras/vilGif3.gif?t=1740117152\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506970/extras/vilGif2.gif?t=1740117152\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506970/extras/vilGif1.gif?t=1740117152\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506970/extras/vilGif4.gif?t=1740117152\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Easy to learn.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo version includes <strong>50 different cards</strong> to add to your deck.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Various random <strong>upgrades.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face off against <strong>2 different bosses.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And... <strong>probably more!</strong></p></li>